The scan server (server/) and the client library (client/) were originally designed and implemented by Dongho Han
(Seoul National University). Jingyu Lee (Seoul National University) packaged and extended the server (configuration,
health service, CPU tests, stub, box and negative prompts) and added the client's TLS transport, the scan API names,
CI and the golden pipeline.

Model weights and model code are NOT part of this repository. At run time the server loads SAM 3
(https://huggingface.co/facebook/sam3) and SAM 3D Objects (https://github.com/facebookresearch/sam-3d-objects,
https://huggingface.co/facebook/sam-3d-objects), "SAM Materials" under Meta's SAM License, which users obtain from
Meta directly; see server/NOTICE and server/THIRD_PARTY.md.

Vendored third-party code: client/third_party/stb (stb_image, stb_image_write by Sean Barrett, MIT or public domain;
used by a test only)
and client/third_party/rules_android_ndk/windows_fix.patch (a patch to rules_android_ndk, Apache-2.0). The client's
prebuilt libraries statically link gRPC, Protocol Buffers, Abseil, BoringSSL and others; their licence texts are in
client/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES-native.txt, which ships with every binary release.
